{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daniel is exhausted. Work has drained him. And things only get worse when he\u2019s forced to pull an all-nighter, just after hearing whispers about something unsettling. The Office Murders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The team has to deliver the entire project by morning, and the pressure is crushing. Normal stuff. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>... Uhn?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You want to know about <u><strong>ITO</strong></u><strong>\u00a0</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br>Why...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>What\u2019s there to know?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This demo begins at the very start of Daniel\u2019s journey, just after he hears about strange rumors spreading through the city. A short glimpse of Chapter 1.</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make choices that shape your relationships with the characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procrastinate\u2026 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to work and finish your tasks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with objects in the scenery.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve light contextual puzzles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate a possible disappearance.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate a possible homicide.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate a possible serial killer.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decide carefully</strong> where to go first\u2026 some special events can be missed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the office at night. <strong>It\u2019s empty...</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4038260?t=1759136925","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038260/7b087d3af1fd9d0982a499785854766d48b0ad9c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759136925","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038260/6460c5b9770440c0184e966b5baabe8772f79415/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759136925","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038260/6460c5b9770440c0184e966b5baabe8772f79415/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759136925","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains themes and references that some players may find disturbing. These include:\r\n\r\nVerbal and physical abuse\r\n\r\nDepression and anxiety\r\n\r\nSuicide\r\n\r\nDescriptions of violent acts\r\n\r\nTorture\r\n\r\nPoisoning\r\n\r\nJumpscares\r\n\r\nPlease note: The game does not feature graphic or explicit depictions of these to